        "type": "quran_excerpt",
        "sentence": "p14.s13",
        "paragraph": "p14",
        "text": "言いなさい。「私は加護を求めます、人々の主に、",
        "sha256_utf8": "2c0d16cdbae505d8e5e2e1e4b01e4fb0c1913f5f2676491c3fff5862afff6578",
        "cp_start": 72,
        "cp_end": 95,
